    "detailed_description": "Let's get ready to rumble! Snakebyte is a fast-pace Snake-like arcade game that will bring back couch-based multiplayer and make your friends scream 'BYTE ME!'. Collect the correct bits to score points and beat your enemies to bits. Or why not try your 'turn-based' skills in the puzzle mode? Plenty of bits for every snake.... or are there?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Fast-paced arcade gameplay<br></li><li> Local multiplayer with up to 4 players<br></li><li> Various game modes (Arcade, Battle, Co-op)<br></li><li> Particles (who doesn't like those?)<br></li><li> Slick retro graphics</li></ul>",
